  lines:
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: Traffic Conius
    textDelay: 0
    text: We'll be needing more of that, that was my last coin. Go to the card shop
      and get a j*b.
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: Traffic Conius
    textDelay: 0
    text: I know that word might be a bit scary to you, but you have to get some
      more money so we can fight Eve L Mart.
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: Traffic Conius
    textDelay: 0
    text: Oh yeah, the card shop is the building that looks like a satchel. Tell
      Mallory I sent you, she'll hire you
